  - m_Id: 11820904394637312
    m_Localized: Additional info
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11829234638897152
    m_Localized: 'This game is created by two students from the School of mathematics
      and science "Academician Nikola Obreshkov" in Burgas, Bulgaria - Anna-Maria
      Dalakmanova from XI d class and Miroslav Kavrukov from XII d class.


      Game
      design, sprites and front-end by Anna-Maria

      Idea, level design and back-end
      by Miroslav


      Other resources:

      Unity documentation, Unity forums,
      Stack Overflow, YouTube'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
