  - m_Id: 13222818226274304
    m_Localized: Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13237038363869184
    m_Localized: Would you like an introduction to the game?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13237341918232576
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13237448961064960
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13237650136662016
    m_Localized: Good enough. Have fun :)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13237978571636736
    m_Localized: Very well. Welcome to Fire-extinguisher! This is a strategic game
      where you take the role of a dispatcher for fire extinguishing teams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13238398094311424
    m_Localized: The controls are simple; you choose and click on a fire engine and
      assign it a task whenever there is an active fire in the city. You have to
      do this for a day within the city but it will take you 1 minute of your time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13239190616440832
    m_Localized: This should be it! Have fun :)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13919542129360896
    m_Localized: You won!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13920161850359808
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations! You passed the tutorial level. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13921586093391872
    m_Localized: You lost :(
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13921556406108160
    m_Localized: But don't give up just yet! Would you like to try again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13963582757568512
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14687727539617792
    m_Localized: Are you sure you want to quit the game?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14688864175030272
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14688980210450432
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14689500111208448
    m_Localized: Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16975134720950272
    m_Localized: What would you like to do with this firetruck?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16975449138561024
    m_Localized: '[E] Extinguish'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16976039826587648
    m_Localized: '[Q] Move'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16977552468770816
    m_Localized: '[W] Stop'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17033159401963520
    m_Localized: Cancel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17599111797571584
    m_Localized: 'Victims:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17600159576653824
    m_Localized: 'Time left:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17617180578185216
    m_Localized: "IMPORTANT!!\nIn a fire, the most underestimated factor is toxic
      gases.\nIn an active fire in an apartment building, DO NOT LEAVE THE APARTMENT
      UNTIL THE FIREFIGHTERS ARRIVE. Place wet towels at the corners and along the
      door seams, and the person should lock themselves in the bathroom WITHOUT TURNING
      ON ANY VENTILATION. A wet cloth over the face is mandatory.\n\nWhat NOT to
      do\n\u2022 Do not use the elevator during a fire.\n\u2022 Do not extinguish
      a grease fire with water (cover the container with a lid or use a fire extinguisher).\n\u2022
      Do not open a door to a smoke-filled room without checking the temperature.\n\nPreventive
      measures:\nDo not overload power strips and outlets \u2013 avoid \u201Cpower
      strip into power strip.\u201D Watch for overheating, burning smell, sparking.
      Use residual current devices (RCD) and automatic circuit breakers.\nDo not
      leave cooking unattended, as fats ignite quickly. Clean range hoods and filters
      from accumulated grease. For stoves and heaters \u2013 maintain a safe distance
      from furniture and curtains. Check connections and hoses for leaks, and if
      you smell gas \u2013 ventilate, do not turn on electrical appliances, and call
      112. Install a gas/carbon monoxide detector if needed. Install smoke detectors
      and test the batteries monthly. Keep a small fire extinguisher, either powder
      or carbon dioxide, in the kitchen/hallway and know how to use it.\nIn case
      of fire, use the designated evacuation exits. Do not store items in stairwells
      and corridors. Maintain fire doors (they should self-close and not be propped
      open). Ensure hydrants and fire extinguishers are functional and inspected
      annually. Train the building manager/personnel for basic incident response.
      Post a clear evacuation plan in visible places and provide emergency lighting.\nEnsure
      free access for fire trucks (no parking in front of hydrants and entrances).
      Control unauthorized burning of waste. Report hazards to the General Directorate
      \u201CFire Safety and Civil Protection.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19201583553085440
    m_Localized: How to assign tasks? Once you've pressed on the firetruck a panel
      with buttons will appear. To give it a task, click a button/its specific key
      - [Q] for moving, [W] for stopping an ongoing task and [E] for extinguishing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19205253409701888
    m_Localized: 'The way [Q] works is after you click the button/key, you point
      at a spot on the map for the firetruck to go to. [E] works once you are close
      enough to a fire and automatically extinguishes everything around the firetruck. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19239926911369216
    m_Localized: '[W] stops the action of [Q] or [E] if they are active. If you would
      like to freeze time to think through and assign tasks in advance, you can press
      [space]. Additionally you can zoom in and zoom out using the mouse scroll. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19242339126902784
    m_Localized: If a fire is left untouched, it will spread, eventually claiming
      victims. You will only win if there are no victims and you have successfully
      extinguished all fires on the map!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42027100878569472
    m_Localized: 'Water resource:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42189858689417216
    m_Localized: What would you like to do with this fire extinguishing helicopter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42190882519023616
    m_Localized: '[R] Recharge'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42192024267292672
    m_Localized: Skip level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42240962944991232
    m_Localized: 'When you want to move the screen along the level, you just move
      the cursor to the border which corresponds to the direction you want to go
      in. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42335738374504448
    m_Localized: Congratulations! You successfully completed the first level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
